sequenceDiagram
 participant C as Customer
 participant LB as HTTPS WAF and Ingress
 participant ID as Enterprise Identity Provider
 participant API as GKE FastAPI Pods
 participant DB as Cloud SQL / ERP Adapter
 participant LLM as Approved Private Model Endpoint
 participant H as Approval Queue
 participant OBS as Audit and Telemetry
 C->>ID: Sign in
 ID-->>C: Signed JWT
 C->>LB: Work-order inquiry
 LB->>API: Forward TLS request
 API->>API: Validate JWT and customer permissions
 API->>DB: Tenant-filtered work-order read
 DB-->>API: Authorized facts
 API->>LLM: Minimized grounded prompt
 LLM-->>API: Draft
 API->>API: Fact/approval policy checks
 opt Restricted decision
 API->>H: Pending review
 H-->>API: Authorized disposition
 end
 API->>OBS: Correlated trace and audit metadata
 API-->>LB: Response/case status
 LB-->>C: Customer-facing response
